toplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e24673cfdf7acea24b99a23af253c38e.poster.avif?t=1755004411\" width=414 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e24673cfdf7acea24b99a23af253c38e.webm?t=1755004411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e24673cfdf7acea24b99a23af253c38e.mp4?t=1755004411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story About Time, Perspective, and Identity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of Echo is a question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if your greatest strength was the ability to pause time \u2014 not to escape, but to listen? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ead15c43ccb452b7200e45900f196d0f.avif?t=1755004411\" data-has-big width=800 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
